#. module: sale_product_matrix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_product_matrix.field_sale_order__grid
msgid ""
"Technical local storage of grid. \n"
"If grid_update, will be loaded on the SO.\n"
"If not, represents the matrix to open."
msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນທາງເຕັກນິກຂອງຕາຕະລາງ. \n"
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ grid_update, ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດໃສ່ໃນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່, ຈະສະແດງເຖິງມາຕຣິກທີ່ຈະເປີດ."

